{"server":"tw","storyId":"act27side_level_act27side_05_beg","groupId":"act27side","stageId":"act27side_05","title":"我會唱一首彩虹","storyCode":"SL-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"4cda75cf32e2ea471e4ad22d5b8104ef6a4bdf51e4c364ce8733b201b53a8bba","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sunnytown_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"為什麼要研究火山？\n我希望有一天，我可以在汐斯塔最高的地方彈吉他。不一定是在黑曜石音樂節上，最好是在火山上。\n我出的第一張專輯，就準備叫《火山奏鳴曲》。\n不能把火山叫醒？啊哈哈......那還是叫《火山安眠曲》吧。\n火山其實睡得很熟的，哪有那麼容易被你叫醒。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你有沒有聽說過，火山上的一種石頭？\n風吹動它，會發出如同豆子落入碗中的響聲。\n浸在水裡，氣泡又會咕嘟咕嘟地冒出來，就像細密的鼓點。\n當然是真的，如果我在哪座火山上找到了這種石頭，我就把它帶回來給你看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生已經來過了，今天感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人躺在病床上，側著頭望向窗外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是你專門來提醒我在這個夏天只能躺在床上的話，還不錯。而且，病床應該也比辦公室的椅子要舒服些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你還有精力調侃我，但這幾天我的屁股就沒有沾過椅子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們應該換換。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人回過頭來，看向站在床邊的自己的孫子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼我的好孫子，今天來找我有什麼事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份搬遷意向書，希望您能簽個字。"},{"type":"narration","text":"市政廳職員像是認錯一樣低聲吐出了這句話。\n然後便是一段疲憊又苦澀的沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看起來改建計劃真的很著急，甚至等不到我咽氣對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不至於這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是覺得，總該讓你知道這件事。當然，能取得你的同意是最好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真的想說服我，至少該帶著泰莎一起來看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也在工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都是為了生活，對吧？真不明白，那樣的女孩子為什麼會同意嫁給你這樣無聊的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當我繼承了您哄女孩開心的天賦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"病房中安靜下來，只有削水果的聲音低低地響起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天，工作很辛苦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近總是莫名其妙做怪夢，想了想自己應該沒得罪過什麼人，所以我猜是你被不少人罵了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您真聰明，對我的工作瞭解得真是一點不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你又是怎麼想的呢？真的願意讓這片商業街拆掉，讓老汐斯塔剩下的最後一點痕跡也消失不見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科斯達，後面的櫃子裡放著一把吉他，拿出來給我彈一首吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧......您知道這樣沒有意義......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人不再說話，把頭扭了過去，看向窗外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道，知更鳥咖啡店在汐斯塔的時間比市政廳還要長。還有那條街上許多家其他的店鋪，從火山那裡搬到這裡的時候都留了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但能讓生活過不下去的困難太多了，火山甚至排不上號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咖啡和音樂只有在特定的時候才能養活人。如果不是我僥倖找到了市政廳的這份工作，您的醫藥費都會是這個家邁不過去的一道坎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是想抱怨什麼，只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"得了，把筆給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科斯達，我討厭你這個臭小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或許我就應該在你用氣泡水兌手沖咖啡的時候把你扔進海裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝您沒真的這麼做......我還是很喜歡您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g12_obsidianhotspringshotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想租用我的旅館？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你允許的範圍內，對這裡的溫泉做一點小小的改造——價錢好商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對錢不感興趣，千篇一律，毫無美感！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，又不是只有錢才能作為交易的籌碼，我這裡絕對有你感興趣的好東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這照片上是......那塊展品級黑曜石？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你管理的幾家溫泉旅館租給我幾天，我就把這塊黑曜石搬到你這裡怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別開玩笑了，這是私人博物館裡的貴重館藏，怎麼可能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到做到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"口說無憑，我們簽個合約吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雪雉，研究一下，我說的那個方案能不能行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可能......可行吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，那就是能行！我相信你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不不不......！不是一定，我需要一些工具和材料......還需要一點......不，很多時間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加油！我先去推進下一步了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然決定把重點放到讓這條街的居民們歡迎我們的改造這一點上，那就要做到極致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拜松用商品博覽會這個招牌吸引到的遊客，我們可不能浪費了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g8_siestavolcanomuseum_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不，不在......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（《火山爆發數據模型》絕對不在瑪格娜教授留給阿黛爾的資料裡。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可為什麼凱勒會有這本筆記......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，要來杯咖啡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不用，我不喝咖啡......阿黛爾今天不在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天並不是工作日，你又在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市政廳那邊的工作需要這些舊檔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒，你到底為什麼要讓阿黛爾來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前應該說得很清楚了，這座博物館的研究和瑙曼夫婦有關，並且汐斯塔的火山即將爆發，這是一次難得的觀測機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾是他們的孩子，也是一個優秀的火山學者，我理應向她發出這次邀請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這麼多年不聯繫之後的現在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏納火山的意外後，你缺席了瑙曼夫婦的葬禮。你徹底從學界銷聲匿跡，從去年開始停止了學校的教職工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾年裡，你到底在做什麼？你在逃避什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你看到的，這幾年我唯一做的事，就是整理現在已放在博物館裡的所有火山研究的資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩，每個人的精力是有極限的。我已經沒有力氣再去火山上做考察了。等博物館建好，等汐斯塔火山觀測結束，我就準備要退休了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......退休？你為什麼還會想到“退休”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑙曼夫婦把所有未公開的研究資料留給你和阿黛爾，這些資源夠你在學界揚名，你卻說要在現在退休？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你早就暗中為這些東西標好了價碼，換到了更大的利益？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩，我不懂你在——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師，您在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凱勒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你有什麼打算，我希望你做任何決定之前能想一想瑙曼老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾是他們唯一的孩子，也是他們留下來的唯一希望。而她已經感染了礦石病，甚至如今的病情並不樂觀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我希望她是快樂和自由的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在，阿黛爾。進來吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師，我找回了那件展品，已經放回展示櫃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，您怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"展品是從哪裡找到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是被偷偷溜進博物館的循獸叼走的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那沒什麼事的話你先——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師，還有一件事......！我在商業街遇到一位店主先生。他讓我把這本書還給您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商業街的一位店主先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g3_siestanewstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在空氣裡嚐到了疲勞的味道，苦苦的，酸酸的，是從誰身上傳出來的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生！嚇我一跳，你怎麼在這裡呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾，我剛剛在城市那頭看到了一抹漂亮的藍色，你想不想去泡溫泉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，我還有研究要做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，“研究”這兩個字苦到都有點皺巴巴的了，火山就在那裡，資料也不會消失，你隨時都可以回來做研究，但——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"多利輕輕一踮腳，在半空中旋轉起來，看起來是在跳一支有些滑稽的舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情可是轉瞬即逝，一旦錯過就不會再有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小艾雅——終於找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，要不要一起去泡溫泉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泡溫泉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒有操控人心的本領哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是什麼？你沒有帶泳衣？沒事，我那裡有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你和我，還有雪雉，我們等下去把錫蘭小姐也叫上，我還買了最新款的面霜——據說添加了火山灰成分哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我還有一件很重要的事拜託你，只有你能做到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是......哥倫比亞的最新款唱片機？居然能在汐斯塔見到......！我可是自己有在特殊關注，才知道它是幾天前才發售的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這已經是賣剩下的了，你錯過了第一波......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道，這邊早上排了特別長的隊，大帝簽名的限量版唱片機還會附贈最新專輯，那一批早都全部售完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大帝的最新專輯？！我記得不是還有一周才正式發售嗎！這叫什麼，拿到了提前批？主辦方是什麼來頭啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不光是大帝的專輯！這邊還有空小姐的簽名專輯、卡西米爾耀騎士的頭盔模型、《車爾尼鋼琴曲集》！......等等，這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，居然在這裡也能看到我們薩爾貢蟹蟹抽水泵啊......但是，這東西在汐斯塔這裡究竟有什麼用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"管他呢，可愛就行了！沒看到很多人都在排隊買嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，這裡還有椰棗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_993_1","isRemote":false,"text":"椰棗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_993_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了，這位來自薩爾貢的先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伯德信手彈起一段薩爾貢風情的小調。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_993_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以給我講講，在乾熱的熏風中採收椰棗的故事嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是從萊塔尼亞運來的樂器，不得不說，萊塔尼亞人在音樂相關的東西上是有一手的。喜歡可以上手試試，有什麼不會的我可以來教您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才彈的這首曲子？是我和我老婆表白時候彈的，嘿嘿。您喜歡的話，我這還有譜子，可以拿去學學啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您問哪家零食好吃？左手邊那個鬍子老爺爺有看到嗎？他家的冰淇淋最好啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢慢來慢慢來，你是草莓你是橘子你是咖啡，還有什麼來著？椰子味拼巧克力？哎呦......不要急，都會有的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，給我來一個紅茶味的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，馬上就來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個也發給黑看一下......饞饞她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭醫生！您也來博覽會啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天正好有空，我就順便逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯，好小子！得虧今早有你幫我修好了收銀機，要不然我真的就忙不過來咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，順手幫個忙而已！您生意怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好得很，差點以為我還在之前的汐斯塔呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但怎麼沒見科斯達那個小子？整天為了這個會跑前跑後，真開起來了他人又不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能今天市政廳還有別的工作吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這小子，連翹個班都不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，來個冰淇淋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來囉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也歡迎各位來我們純白火山嚐嚐雞尾酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你小子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃尼斯靠在冷飲櫃上，看著周圍人來人往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們剛剛看到我弟弟和妹妹了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們第一次見到這麼熱鬧的地方，一路上吵著要喝什麼火山咖啡，我剛把零用錢給他們，一轉眼連人帶錢全都跑沒影了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我剛才在這裡沒看到有小孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩子肯定不在這裡，要找他們，你要往東街那邊走走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊說是有什麼新落成的遊樂場，我家臭小子吃早飯的時候還說幫我看店，哼，聽到有遊樂場之後我就再沒看到過他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遊樂場？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g12_obsidianhotspringshotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"詩懷雅小姐，我現在能睜眼了嗎？你說有很重要的事情到底是什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是溫泉旅館也出現了那些最近偷偷開採的黑曜石嗎？還是你的工作需要一名火山研究者掛名？還是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都不是啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有火山、沒有數據，只有會讓人很舒服的溫泉，你現在只需要穿著好看的衣服，然後——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在可以睜眼了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......好多遊客啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡怎麼全變樣了？之前不還是一片溫泉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真熱鬧，好像幾年前的汐斯塔啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾聲遊客的歡呼傳來，阿黛爾從驚訝中回過神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多橡皮艇和水上設施，詩懷雅小姐，這些是你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我為商業街準備的水上樂園！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......這些全都是詩懷雅小姐做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我一個人的功勞啦，除了我提供的方案以外，它的落地和實現多虧了我們龍門的首席天才工程師，雪雉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚！詩、詩懷雅小姐......這個稱號太誇張了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎國第一，泰拉第一天才工程師雪雉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，雪雉小姐，不要亂跑啊，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢噢——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客驚呼聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"飛、飛起來了——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是怎麼做到的？這些衝浪皮艇居然會從一個溫泉水道直接飛到另一個溫泉水道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，沒有看起來那麼複雜啦，只需要在水道中添加一個氣動彈射裝置，皮艇開到這裡，就會觸發機關，然後它就會——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客驚呼聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耶！我會飛了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客驚呼聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，水道旁邊也沒有護欄，我有點擔心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據詩懷雅小姐說的，我重新設計了皮艇，給它裝配了全方位的應急緩震系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是衝浪皮艇的第二種玩法，碰碰皮艇！遊客可以在水道中自由碰撞，減震系統會吸收掉所有衝擊力，化成皮艇水槍裡噴向對面的水花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我沒有說，但是不少遊客好像已經掌握了這個訣竅呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看那邊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小遊客歡呼聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴隨著一陣尖叫聲，一艘皮艇在水道中一個旋轉，眼看就要掉下來了。\n皮艇邊緣迅速膨脹起氣囊，將乘坐者包裹在中心，但下落的弧線卻突然中斷，彷彿空氣中存在著什麼透明的屏障一樣。\n水花濺落在地上，被完全包裹著的皮艇這才晃晃悠悠，向下跌去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——你們怎麼樣！有沒有受傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等我一下，小艾雅，我先過去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"街上的遊客都圍了上去，皮艇中卻傳來了咯咯的笑聲。\n隨著鼓囊囊的氣墊一陣鼓動，兩個小孩從裡面鑽了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不開心的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，都怪你亂動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不開心的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小毛羊也沒抓到，我們的“汐斯塔探險”計劃還泡湯了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"很開心的小男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才不是因為我呢！是小毛羊的速度太快啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小毛羊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡也沒有看到......平時你照顧弟弟妹妹也很辛苦吧？這個年紀的小孩子都很愛玩愛鬧的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，謝謝關心，不過這樣也挺好的，起碼他們過得是真的快樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做哥哥的確實會操心很多事情啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回想起了一些自己之前的事情......噗，總感覺有位朋友偶爾也會這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭醫生有位兄長或是姐姐嗎？我還從來沒有聽說過——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都怪你！都怪你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！兩個小傢伙！你們跑哪裡去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是埃尼斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩&小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們坐著大氣墊船，去追小毛羊了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說什麼呢？什麼毛羊......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是那種會頂我們的船，還把我們的船頂翻了當皮球踢的小毛羊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們追到它，一定要讓它坐我們的船！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯，快看，小毛羊又回來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抬頭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們家的衝浪板......怎麼都在天上飛啊？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"衝浪板、游泳圈。\n乘著溫泉蒸汽躍起，跨越風情街上空，跨越遊客們的視線。\n所有人都目不轉睛地看著這些物品如同活物一般地旋動身子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而在阿黛爾的眼中，與其他人略有區別。\n那些從天上飄過去的衝浪板，上面站著幾隻小羊。\n它們似乎並不滿足於僅在水道之中競速——\n熱水、霧氣、五顏六色的衝浪板和游泳圈，被小羊們裹挾著，一同湧入風情街的熱鬧之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（這......太糟糕了！多利先生每次都說會教訓它們，是不是都是在騙我？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（天哪，它們把溫泉水灑得到處都是！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......雪雉，是因為我否定了你摩天輪懸空溫泉的點子，所以你背著我偷偷設計了飛行衝浪板嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個不是詩懷雅小姐你秘密安排的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......也不是我啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人對視了一眼，然後遲疑著將目光看向一直站在一旁的阿黛爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不不不！也不是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪了，難道是拜松？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呦呼——小毛羊，小毛羊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小毛羊飛上天啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊——小艾雅，雪雉——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些衝浪板真的會飛！先別管了，快上衝浪板一起玩吧——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老闆是誰？量產，快量產這種衝浪板！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呦呼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，多利先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_989_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你說的泡溫泉嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
